        "category": "supportive",
        "requiredForDiagnosis": false
      }
    ],
    "minimumForDiagnosis": "Presence of all three major criteria: clinical presentation, biochemical evidence, and genetic confirmation",
    "notes": "Diagnosis requires exclusion of other mitochondrial and metabolic disorders."
